@startuml
[*] --> LoggedIn
LoggedIn -> OrderPlaced: Place order
OrderPlaced -> InvoiceGenerated: Generate invoice
InvoiceGenerated -> PurchaseCompleted: Complete purchase
PurchaseCompleted -> ReplaceOrCancel: Allow replacement/cancellation
ReplaceOrCancel -> ViewReports: View transaction summary
ViewReports --> [*]
@enduml
